cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "LVMRP: Longitudinal Virtual Molecular Response Profiling"
abstract: >-
  A method for predicting spatially-resolved changes in molecular state
  (e.g. delta HER2 expression, delta pathway activity, delta immune
  infiltration) from H&E whole-slide images acquired at two or more time
  points from the same subject, outputting quantitative delta maps and
  uncertainty maps, without generating RGB stained images. Published as a
  defensive publication; the core hypothesis is unvalidated and the negative
  experimental evidence is disclosed in full.
authors:
  - family-names: "IRIXEN"
    given-names: "Patho Team"
    name: "IRIXEN Patho Team"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/lanche-furry/LVMRP"
url: "https://github.com/lanche-furry/LVMRP"
keywords:
